<title>ISRAEL: Rockets slam into northern Israel.</title>
<headline>Rockets slam into northern Israel.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Katyusha rockets fired from Lebanon slammed into northern Israel early on Friday, lightly injuring a woman and damaging a Jewish synagogue, Israeli military sources said.</p>
<p>The woman was injured by glass shards, Israel Radio said. It was the second day the rockets were fired at Israel since the pro-Iranian Party of God, Hizbollah, threatened to carry out suicide bombings inside Israel.</p>
</text>
